01:09:03,333 --> 01:09:09,333
The Gentlemen is a 2019 action comedy film, directed and produced by Guy
Ritchie, co-written with Marn Davies and Ivan Atkinson.

12
01:15:20,000 --> 01:15:26,000
Starring Matthew McConaughey, Charlie Hunnam, Henry Golding, Michelle Dockery, Jeremy Strong, Eddie Marsan, Colin Farrell, and Hugh Grant, the film
follows an American drug lord in England who is looking to sell his business, setting off a chain of blackmail and schemes to undermine him.

13
01:21:36,666 --> 01:21:42,666
The Gentlemen premiered at the Curzon Mayfair Cinema on 3 December 2019, and was released in cinemas in the United Kingdom on
1 January 2020, by Entertainment Film Distributors, and in the United States on 24 January 2020, by STXfilms.

14
01:27:53,333 --> 01:27:59,333
